    "detailed_description": "<strong>ORB HUNTER</strong><br><br>In a world filled with darkness, orbs infused from darkness are spread around the world,<br>orbs became the main source of power, sought by kings and mercenaries around the world.<br><br>Orb hunt became a good source of gold, orb hunters and orb hunt clans spread around the world.<br><br>You are an Orb Hunter of the orb hunt clan West Hunters, you are assigned a job to retrieve a fire orb, heard to exist in the valley keep.<br>Join our clan, hunter! and lets find gold and glory.<br><br><br><strong>What To Expect</strong> (might include spoilers)<br>* 60-120 minutes of gameplay.<br>* 2 orbs to collect and use.<br>* treasures to find and collect.<br>* a whole keep you can explore and unlock doors, no loading screens.<br>* 3 types of weapons and skills.<br>* <strong>Difficulty 8 out of 10</strong>, it lies in discovering and exploring the area, and dealing with enemies.<br><br><strong>Please check the Manual in the store page to know more about the objectives, controls and tips.</strong><br><br><strong>About Game Development</strong><br>I\u2019m Saud Alomari, I\u2019m a passionate game developer, I\u2019ve been hobby programming and developing with Unity for more than 5 years, and Orb Hunter is my serious project that put my skills in use and I would love to present it to you.<br>I started developing this game on October 2022.<br>Please contact me if you have any questions or feedback, I\u2019d be glad to communicate with you.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>ORB HUNTER</strong><br><br>In a world filled with darkness, orbs infused from darkness are spread around the world,<br>orbs became the main source of power, sought by kings and mercenaries around the world.<br><br>Orb hunt became a good source of gold, orb hunters and orb hunt clans spread around the world.<br><br>You are an Orb Hunter of the orb hunt clan West Hunters, you are assigned a job to retrieve a fire orb, heard to exist in the valley keep.<br>Join our clan, hunter! and lets find gold and glory.<br><br><br><strong>What To Expect</strong> (might include spoilers)<br>* 60-120 minutes of gameplay.<br>* 2 orbs to collect and use.<br>* treasures to find and collect.<br>* a whole keep you can explore and unlock doors, no loading screens.<br>* 3 types of weapons and skills.<br>* <strong>Difficulty 8 out of 10</strong>, it lies in discovering and exploring the area, and dealing with enemies.<br><br><strong>Please check the Manual in the store page to know more about the objectives, controls and tips.</strong><br><br><strong>About Game Development</strong><br>I\u2019m Saud Alomari, I\u2019m a passionate game developer, I\u2019ve been hobby programming and developing with Unity for more than 5 years, and Orb Hunter is my serious project that put my skills in use and I would love to present it to you.<br>I started developing this game on October 2022.<br>Please contact me if you have any questions or feedback, I\u2019d be glad to communicate with you.",
